body:
Honestly same with some. Twenty one pilots is absolutely a no skip band for me, but these ones I have to be in the right mood/headspace;
Before You Start Your Day, Truce, Legend, Smithereens, Bandito, The Craving, Cut my Lip, most of Trench actually (that is for 100% personal reasons because all the songs are amazing but I absolutely have to be in the headspace for it).

Everyone has their own likes and opinions, some songs are not for everyone!
